{"id":"a84438ff57f97872","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-quadpbmincut.md","title":"Minimizers extracted from minimum cuts","display":"thm-quadpbmincut — Minimizers extracted from minimum cuts","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-quadpbmincut","aliases":["27-thm-quadpbmincut"],"display":"thm-quadpbmincut — Minimizers extracted from minimum cuts","depends_on":["[[27-df-quadcut]]","[[27-df-pbopt]]","[[27-thm-quadmincut]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.6.3","source_statement":"Local optimizer correspondence for the network reduction on p.603","source_printed_pages":"603","source_pdf_pages":"627","verification_status":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-quadpbmincut"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-quadpbmincut</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-quadpbmincut — Minimizers extracted from minimum cuts"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"32e50ab8f941fd9b\" href=\"?note=32e50ab8f941fd9b\" title=\"27-df-quadcut\">27-df-quadcut</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a668791f62b82e2a\" href=\"?note=a668791f62b82e2a\" title=\"27-df-pbopt\">27-df-pbopt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1d0e29e9558d4e2f\" href=\"?note=1d0e29e9558d4e2f\" title=\"27-thm-quadmincut\">27-thm-quadmincut</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.6.3"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Local optimizer correspondence for the network reduction on p.603"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"603"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"627"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note-source-context-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n\">\\(q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_q,S_n,X_n,\\operatorname{Cap}_q,\\kappa(q),\\mathrm{MinCut}(q)\">\\(\\mathcal C_q,S_n,X_n,\\operatorname{Cap}_q,\\kappa(q),\\mathrm{MinCut}(q)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"32e50ab8f941fd9b\" href=\"?note=32e50ab8f941fd9b\" title=\"27-df-quadcut\">27-df-quadcut</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBArgmin}\">\\(\\mathrm{PBArgmin}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a668791f62b82e2a\" href=\"?note=a668791f62b82e2a\" title=\"27-df-pbopt\">27-df-pbopt</a>），逐点容量等式（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1d0e29e9558d4e2f\" href=\"?note=1d0e29e9558d4e2f\" title=\"27-thm-quadmincut\">27-thm-quadmincut</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(X_n(S_n(x))=x)\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathcal C_q\\;(S_n(X_n(S))=S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(X_n(S_n(x))=x)\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathcal C_q\\;(S_n(X_n(S))=S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\min_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}q(x)=\\kappa(q)+\\mathrm{MinCut}(q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\min_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}q(x)=\\kappa(q)+\\mathrm{MinCut}(q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall S\\in\\mathcal C_q\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Cap}_q(S)=\\mathrm{MinCut}(q)\\Longleftrightarrow X_n(S)\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(q)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall S\\in\\mathcal C_q\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Cap}_q(S)=\\mathrm{MinCut}(q)\\Longleftrightarrow X_n(S)\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(q)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>S_n 和 X_n 互逆，故向量与真正的 source–sink cuts 一一对应；再由逐点相等及加常数不改变极小点，得到最优值和解的对应。原书 p.603 论述网络归约；这里补全了抽取解所需的方向与双射。若 coefficients 用二进制有理数显式给出，所建网络有 n+2 个顶点、至多 n(n−1)+2n 条非零弧，容量只用有理加法和二分得到；本定理不对任意实数 oracle 输入声称位复杂度。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-quadcut","status":"resolved","id":"32e50ab8f941fd9b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quadcut]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbopt","status":"resolved","id":"a668791f62b82e2a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbopt]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-quadmincut","status":"resolved","id":"1d0e29e9558d4e2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-quadmincut]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quadcut","status":"resolved","id":"32e50ab8f941fd9b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n$；$\\mathcal C_q,S_n,X_n,\\operatorname{Cap}_q,\\kappa(q),\\mathrm{MinCut}(q)$（see [[27-df-quadcut]]），$\\mathrm{PBArgmin}$（see [[27-df-pbopt]]），逐点容量等式（see [[27-thm-quadmincut]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbopt","status":"resolved","id":"a668791f62b82e2a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n$；$\\mathcal C_q,S_n,X_n,\\operatorname{Cap}_q,\\kappa(q),\\mathrm{MinCut}(q)$（see [[27-df-quadcut]]），$\\mathrm{PBArgmin}$（see [[27-df-pbopt]]），逐点容量等式（see [[27-thm-quadmincut]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-quadmincut","status":"resolved","id":"1d0e29e9558d4e2f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n$；$\\mathcal C_q,S_n,X_n,\\operatorname{Cap}_q,\\kappa(q),\\mathrm{MinCut}(q)$（see [[27-df-quadcut]]），$\\mathrm{PBArgmin}$（see [[27-df-pbopt]]），逐点容量等式（see [[27-thm-quadmincut]]）。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathrm{QuadPB}_n\\cap\\mathrm{Submodular}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_q,S_n,X_n,\\operatorname{Cap}_q,\\kappa(q),\\mathrm{MinCut}(q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBArgmin}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(X_n(S_n(x))=x)\\land\\forall S\\in\\mathcal C_q\\;(S_n(X_n(S))=S).","display":true},{"tex":"\\min_{x\\in\\mathbb B^n}q(x)=\\kappa(q)+\\mathrm{MinCut}(q).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall S\\in\\mathcal C_q\\;\\left(\\operatorname{Cap}_q(S)=\\mathrm{MinCut}(q)\\Longleftrightarrow X_n(S)\\in\\mathrm{PBArgmin}(q)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1961,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-530","l